  m_Text: "\u25CF A tiny computer that can run full programs, unlike Arduino which
    follows simple\r\ncommands.\r\n\u25CF Has 40 GPIO (General Purpose Input/Output)
    pins for connecting sensors,\r\nbuflons, and motors.\r\n\u25CF Can run Python-based
    programs, AI models, and even small games.\r\n\u25CF Used when a project needs
    image processing, internet connectivity, or advanced\r\ncomputing.\n"
