  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7Detects movement of people or animals.\r\n\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7Works
    by sensing heat (infrared radiation) from objects.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7Has
    one output pin that turns HIGH (1) when motion is detected.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF \uF0B7
    Used in security alarms and automatic lights."
