  m_Text: "\u25CF Uses sound waves (like a bat) to measure distance.\r\n\u25CF Has
    Trigger and Echo pins to send and receive sound signals.\r\n\u25CF Can detect
    objects up to 4 meters\r\naway.\r\n\u25CF Used in robots to avoid obstacles."
