  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7 \uF0B7A motor that spins when powered.\r\n\u25CF
    \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7 \uF0B7The L298N driver module controls the speed and
    direction of the motor.\r\n\uF0B7 \u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7 Needs two output
    pins to control the motor\u2019s movement.\r\n\uF0B7 \u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7
    Used in robot cars and moving gadgets."
