  m_Text: "\u25CF Small electronic components that reduce or control the flow of
    electric current.\r\n\u25CF Protect sensitive parts like LEDs from getting too
    much current.\r\n\u25CF Come in different resistance values, identified by colored
    bands.\r\n\u25CF Essential for balancing and stabilizing circuits."
