  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7A small screen that displays text and numbers.\r\n\u25CF
    \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7Uses I2C (2-wire communication) to talk to the Arduino.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF
    \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7Can show sensor values, messages, and countdown timers.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF
    \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7Used in digital clocks, vending machines, and DIY gadgets."
