  m_Text: "\u25CF The main controller that thinks and decides what to do.\r\n\u25CF
    Has 14 digital pins (D0 to D13) for ON/OFF signals (like turning a light on or
    off).\r\n\u25CF Has 6 analog pins (A0 to A5) for sensors that need detailed readings
    (like\r\nmeasuring temperature).\r\n\u25CF Connects with sensors, motors, and
    displays to control projects.\n"
