  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7 Supplies power to the Arduino and other
    components.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7 Can be connected using a
    battery clip or DC (Direct Current) jack.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7
    Provides 9V, but Arduino needs 5V, so a voltage regulator may be needed.\r\n\uF0B7
    \u25CF \uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7\uF0B7 Used to make projects portable!"
