  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7 Measures how bright or dark the surroundings are.\r\n\u25CF
    \uF0B7\uF0B7 Works by changing resistance when light levels change.\r\n\uF0B7
    \u25CF \uF0B7Uses an analog pin to give smooth light readings.\r\n\uF0B7 \u25CF
    \uF0B7Used in streetlights that turn on automatically at night."
