  m_Text: "\u25CF Detects objects using invisible infrared light.\r\n\uF0B7\u25CF
    Has one digital output pin (HIGH = object detected, LOW = no object).\r\n\u25CF
    Used in remote controls, line-following robots, and touchless buflons."
