  m_Text: "\u25CF When pressed, it sends a HIGH (1) signal to the Arduino.\r\n\u25CF
    When released, it sends a LOW (0) signal.\r\n\u25CF Used to start/stop things,
    like a video game controller buflon.\r\n\u25CF Can be small or large based on
    the project.\n"
