  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7 A plastic board with small holes where wires and components
    can be connected.\r\n\uF0B7 \u25CF \uF0B7 Uses horizontal and vertical tracks
    to pass electricity.\r\n\uF0B7 \u25CF \uF0B7 Lets you build circuits without
    soldering (no permanent connections).\r\n\uF0B7 \u25CF \uF0B7 Has power rails
    (+ and -) to distribute electricity easily."
