  m_Text: "\u25CF \uF0B7 Red = Warning, Green = Safe, Yellow = Caution, White = Normal
    Light\r\n\u25CF \uF0B7 Connects to digital pins on the Arduino.\r\n\u25CF \uF0B7
    Can blink, fade, or stay ON to show different statuses.\r\n\u25CF \uF0B7 Used
    in traffic lights, status indicators, and alarms."
