  m_Text: "\u25CF Measures temperature (in \xB0C) and humidity (how much water is
    in the air).\r\n\u25CF Uses 1 digital pin to send data to the Arduino.\r\n\u25CF
    Great for weather stations and smart fans.\r\n\u25CF Can sense temperatures between
    0\xB0C to 50\xB0C."
